Unofficial tributes
-------------------
The pop-culture scene pack (src/scenes/pop-culture) is an unofficial tribute.
It parodies The Office, Parks and Recreation, Star Wars (Darth Vader and Yoda)
and Spider-Man, which belong to their respective owners. SignForge is not
affiliated with or endorsed by those works, their studios, networks or rights
holders. The pack uses only names and short parody lines of text, for
identification and parody. It contains no footage, logos, artwork or fonts
from those works. Distributors who want to avoid any association can remove it
by deleting that folder and its single import (see the README).

